        </Section>

        <Section as="article" title="Section with Whimsy">
          <h2>tehehe</h2>
          adding an image here!<br />
          <img src="/public/imgs/halflife.gif" alt="[hl banner gif]"/>this is just text after the image lol <br />
          i need to adjust sm still pls dont looks at this
        </Section>

        </div>
        <aside class="right-column">

        <Section as="article" id="socials" title="socials">
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/weltraumimport/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">GitHub - weltraumimport</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://bsky.app/profile/weltraumimport.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Bluesky - @weltraumimport</a></li>
